FerrionOS change to upstream RedoxFS (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 5ba45a6887374ab425326656a276bb3b62eba7dc after the existing recipe patches. Found by the deterministic simulation in sim/redoxfs (sim/redoxfs/run.sh replay FILE runs a replay).

When the last name of a file that is still open is removed, the node goes to the release list but kept its old link count of 1 on disk.

Replay (seed 17): create /g0; open /g0; unlink /g0 leaves the released node with 1 link. Without this patch 120 of 120 simulated seeds fail.
